thermoservice (0.8) stable; urgency=medium

  * Add thermoservice-homeassistant package with ha_push.py push script
  * Add systemd timer pushing DS18B20 temperature to Home Assistant every 60s
  * Add /etc/default/thermoservice-homeassistant config file
  * Fix temperature display precision to 4 decimal places matching
    DS18B20 sensor resolution (0.0625°C)

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Sat, 09 May 2026 06:25:02 +0200

